2388
01:37:36.077 --> 01:37:38.292
decades, a disenfranchisement

2389
01:37:38.292 --> 01:37:42.750
and systemic racism and people of color

2390
01:37:42.750 --> 01:37:43.930
in the community feeling like

2391
01:37:43.930 --> 01:37:47.490
they had no voice and rightly feeling

2392
01:37:47.490 --> 01:37:49.678
like they were betrayed by their government

2393
01:37:49.678 --> 01:37:52.096
and consistently lied to.

2394
01:37:52.096 --> 01:37:53.970
And so when you recognize that

2395
01:37:53.970 --> 01:37:56.700
you realize that the problem you're solving for

2396
01:37:56.700 --> 01:37:59.810
is in part water in the short term, of course,

2397
01:37:59.810 --> 01:38:00.643
you need to make sure

2398
01:38:00.643 --> 01:38:01.860
you don't poison an entire generation,

2399
01:38:01.860 --> 01:38:05.033
which is what was happening, but it was trust.

2400
01:38:05.033 --> 01:38:08.650
And that introduced a whole

2401
01:38:08.650 --> 01:38:10.482
set of interesting questions

2402
01:38:10.482 --> 01:38:12.069
in the psychological domain,

2403
01:38:12.069 --> 01:38:14.738
which is how does a community

2404
01:38:14.738 --> 01:38:18.030
