2405
01:38:18.030 --> 01:38:20.157
good reason to trust their government.

2406
01:38:20.157 --> 01:38:25.157
And you can imagine how erosive that is, right.

2407
01:38:26.120 --> 01:38:28.660
And this would play out.

2408
01:38:28.660 --> 01:38:29.880
Even the decisions we made

2409
01:38:29.880 --> 01:38:31.749
around the way that we are getting this water

2410
01:38:31.749 --> 01:38:34.340
safety information in the hands of Flint residents.

2411
01:38:34.340 --> 01:38:35.280
I remember so

2412
01:38:36.698 --> 01:38:41.438
we think a lot about who the messenger is in this field,

2413
01:38:41.438 --> 01:38:43.010
right, so what we've learned

2414
01:38:43.010 --> 01:38:44.430
