2416
01:38:45.657 --> 01:38:48.750
what the message is as who, or who it is.

2417
01:38:48.750 --> 01:38:49.700
Who's delivering the message

2418
01:38:49.700 --> 01:38:51.481
as what the message itself is.

2419
01:38:51.481 --> 01:38:56.481
And I think naturally our instinct

2420
01:38:56.880 --> 01:39:00.050
is to go to the environmental protection agency, right.

2421
01:39:00.050 --> 01:39:02.370
Like they are the leading authority figures

2422
01:39:02.370 --> 01:39:04.252
in when it comes to environmental safety.

2423
01:39:04.252 --> 01:39:06.230
And so they should be the ones

2424
01:39:06.230 --> 01:39:08.337
delivering this message to people on the ground.

2425
01:39:08.337 --> 01:39:09.680
But then rich, you think about

2426
01:39:09.680 --> 01:39:10.870
the backdrop here, right.

2427
01:39:10.870 --> 01:39:11.970
Which is that Flint residents

2428
01:39:11.970 --> 01:39:13.790
had been lied to four years

2429
01:39:13.790 --> 01:39:15.147
by their local government.

2430
01:39:15.147 --> 01:39:16.510
If they had been doing its job.

2431
01:39:16.510 --> 01:39:19.050
They wouldn't be in that situation to begin with.

2432
01:39:19.050 --> 01:39:20.680
Or their local government

2433
01:39:20.680 --> 01:39:21.513
had let them down.

2434
01:39:21.513 --> 01:39:22.660
And you could absolutely imagine

2435
01:39:22.660 --> 01:39:27.006
that that would translate to the federal government,

2436
01:39:27.006 --> 01:39:30.044
like your feelings about government

2437
01:39:30.044 --> 01:39:32.744
aren't boxed into, oh, I don't trust my,

2438
01:39:32.744 --> 01:39:35.178
whatever my mayor or my whatever.

2439
01:39:35.178 --> 01:39:37.670
No, you just have a general feeling

2440
01:39:37.670 --> 01:39:39.470
sometimes towards whether the government

2441
01:39:39.470 --> 01:39:40.830
is an entity you can trust or not.

2442
01:39:40.830 --> 01:39:42.343
And there was no reason

2443
01:39:42.343 --> 01:39:43.630
