2454
01:40:05.783 --> 01:40:09.894
And so we're talking heads of churches,

2455
01:40:09.894 --> 01:40:11.807
heads of the red cross

2456
01:40:11.807 --> 01:40:14.799
members of the YMCA people that you're running into

2457
01:40:14.799 --> 01:40:16.490
as part of your day to day life.

2458
01:40:16.490 --> 01:40:17.639
Oh, my kid goes to,

2459
01:40:17.639 --> 01:40:20.960
you know, baseball practice with your kid.

2460
01:40:20.960 --> 01:40:22.290
I see you every week.

2461
01:40:22.290 --> 01:40:23.123
I reason to trust you.
Sure.

2462
01:40:23.123 --> 01:40:24.890
And so those folks would go

2463
01:40:24.890 --> 01:40:26.930
door to door knocking and saying, hi,

2464
01:40:26.930 --> 01:40:29.686
I come a trusted member of your community

2465
01:40:29.686 --> 01:40:33.285
