01:40:42.270 --> 01:40:45.109
So I was really sad I remember.

2472
01:40:45.109 --> 01:40:47.250
So that program was discontinued.

2473
01:40:47.250 --> 01:40:48.850
Yeah it was an effort.

2474
01:40:48.850 --> 01:40:51.580
I mean, gosh, this is so painful.

