2483
01:41:18.102 --> 01:41:19.986
And now it was like,

2484
01:41:19.986 --> 01:41:22.560
is it, are we gonna get anything?

2485
01:41:22.560 --> 01:41:24.980
Are we gonna get negative support?

2486
01:41:24.980 --> 01:41:27.760
Are we, what, like, what is,

2487
01:41:27.760 --> 01:41:29.000
what does the future hold?

2488
01:41:29.000 --> 01:41:30.990
That was so that was so sad

2489
01:41:30.990 --> 01:41:33.945
to be there knowing that there wasn't a future

2490
01:41:33.945 --> 01:41:38.182
where we could help them through that.

2491
01:41:38.182 --> 01:41:39.642
It's so crazy that this problem.

2492
01:41:39.642 --> 01:41:40.475
It was really hard.

2493
01:41:40.475 --> 01:41:42.510
Which persists in Flint.

2494
01:41:42.510 --> 01:41:45.710
Yeah, I know and it's gonna be a problem for a long time.

2495
01:41:45.710 --> 01:41:46.996
So I just,

2496
01:41:46.996 --> 01:41:49.333
I remember knowing in that last,

2497
01:41:49.333 --> 01:41:52.642
in that trip right after the election, like,,

2498
01:41:52.642 --> 01:41:56.300
this is kind of our goodbye trip.

2499
01:41:56.300 --> 01:41:57.450
And we gotten to know

