2507
01:42:09.990 --> 01:42:13.070
Yeah well, extrapolating on that idea of,

2508
01:42:13.070 --> 01:42:17.140
of leveraging cognitive science to

2509
01:42:17.140 --> 01:42:20.489
engender trust where that trust is broken,

2510
01:42:20.489 --> 01:42:22.541
scaling that up to

2511
01:42:22.541 --> 01:42:24.809
the broader kind of

2512
01:42:24.809 --> 01:42:28.661
national declining trust in institutions.

2513
01:42:28.661 --> 01:42:31.230
Like what does behavioral science say

2514
01:42:31.230 --> 01:42:33.240
