2549
01:43:39.540 --> 01:43:41.720
So broken stoplights, broken stop sign,

2550
01:43:41.720 --> 01:43:42.880
potholes in the ground.

2551
01:43:42.880 --> 01:43:45.040
And they're like, when is this stuff gonna get fixed?

2552
01:43:45.040 --> 01:43:47.414
Like we gotta keep living our lives here in Boston.

2553
01:43:47.414 --> 01:43:51.230
And what the city did

2554
01:43:51.230 --> 01:43:52.680
is they created a virtual map

2555
01:43:52.680 --> 01:43:54.230
in which they simply ID

2556
01:43:54.230 --> 01:43:55.530
that all these problems were happening

2557
01:43:55.530 --> 01:43:57.331
and they showed where those problems were.

2558
01:43:57.331 --> 01:44:01.500
And then they had these little progress meters, right.

2559
01:44:01.500 --> 01:44:02.570
Where you could actually see

2560
01:44:02.570 --> 01:44:03.906
that like, oh, this road sign,

2561
01:44:03.906 --> 01:44:06.410
you know, could maybe get fixed on Thursday,

2562
01:44:06.410 --> 01:44:07.630
or at least it's next in line.

2563
01:44:07.630 --> 01:44:09.720
And even though the speed

2564
01:44:09.720 --> 01:44:10.570
with which the problems

2565
01:44:10.570 --> 01:44:12.481
were gonna be fix was unlikely to change.

2566
01:44:12.481 --> 01:44:15.607
The mere transparency into the process

2567
01:44:15.607 --> 01:44:19.240
was extremely assistive in building trust.

2568
01:44:19.240 --> 01:44:21.660
And in this case, the study showed I believe that

2569
01:44:21.660 --> 01:44:24.600
it led people to be more civically minded.

2570
01:44:24.600 --> 01:44:25.890
